attery dying fast"}],"? If your iPhone won't hold a charge, shuts off randomly, or shows a “Service” battery warning, you need an ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"iPhone battery replacement in Macon GA"}],". Our technicians replace iPhone batteries in about 30 minutes using premium cells that restore your phone's all-day battery life. We service all models including ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"iPhone 13 battery replacement"}],", ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"iPhone 14 battery replacement"}],", and ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"iPhone 15 battery replacement"}]," in Macon."]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-foreground mt-8","children":"Why Macon Residents Choose Tech Medics for iPhone Repair"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground mb-4","children":["Unlike mail-in repair services or the Apple Store in Atlanta, Tech Medics is right here in Macon at ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"3742 Eisenhower Parkway"}],". We offer ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"same-day iPhone repair"}]," with no appointment required. Our certified technicians have repaired thousands of iPhones, and every repair comes with a warranty. We're proud to serve all of Macon including ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Vineville, North Macon, Ingleside, Downtown, East Macon, South Macon"}],", and nearby cities like ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Warner Robins, Byron, Perry, and Forsyth"}],"."]}]]}]}]}]
